      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abiiyaah, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sannaddii siddeed iyo tobnaad ee Boqor Yaaraabcaam ayaa Abiiyaah boqor ka noqday dalka Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saddex sannadood ayuu boqor ku ahaa Yeruusaalem, oo hooyadiis magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Miikaayaah ina Uurii'eel oo reer Gibecaah ah. Oo Abiiyaah iyo Yaaraabcaamna dagaal baa ka dhexayn jiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Abiiyaah dagaal buu u baxay isagoo wata ciidan dagaalyahan ah oo xoog badan, oo waxayna ahaayeen afar boqol oo kun oo ah rag la xushay; oo Yaaraabcaamna wuxuu dagaal isaga ka gees ah u diyaariyey siddeed boqol oo kun oo nin oo ah rag la xushay oo dhammaantoodna rag xoog badan ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Abiiyaah wuxuu kor fuulay Buur Semaarayim oo ku taal dalka buuraha leh oo reer Efrayim, oo wuxuu yidhi, Yaaraabcaam iyo dadkii Israa'iil dhammaantiin i maqla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War, miyeydnaan ogayn in Rabbiga Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil ahu Daa'uud weligiis siiyey boqortooyada reer binu Israa'iil u talisa oo wuxuu isaga iyo wiilashiisana ku siiyey axdi cusbo leh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin Yaaraabcaam ina Nebaad oo ahaa addoonkii Sulaymaan ina Daa'uud ayaa kacay oo ka fallaagoobay sayidkiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa isagii u soo shiray rag xunxun oo waxmatarayaal ah, wayna xoogaysteen iyagoo ka gees ah Rexabcaam oo ahaa ina Sulaymaan, oo taasuna waxay ahayd intii Rexabcaam uu dhallintayaraa oo uu qalbigiisu nuglaa, oo uusan iyaga hor joogsan karin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hadda idinku waxaad ku fikiraysaan inaad boqortooyada Rabbiga ka hor joogsataan gacanta ilma Daa'uud, oo weliba idinku waxaad tihiin dad faro badan, oo waxaadna wadataan weylihii dahabka ahaa oo Yaaraabcaam idiinku sameeyey Ilaah ahaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba idinku sow ma aydaan eryin wadaaddadii Rabbiga oo ilma Haaruun ahaa iyo kuwii reer Laawiba? Oo wadaaddo sow uma aydaan samaysan sidii ay ahaan jirtay caadadii dadyowga dalalka kale deggan? Oo sidaas daraaddeed ku alla kii u yimaadaa inuu quduus iska dhigo isagoo wata dibi yar iyo toddoba wan, kaasu wuxuu wadaad u noqon karaa waxyaalo aan ilaahyo ahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Rabbigu waa Ilaahayaga, oo kama aannu tegin, oo waxaannu haysannaa wadaaddo Rabbiga u adeega, kuwaasoo ah ilma Haaruun, iyo kuwii reer Laawi oo shuqulkoodii ku jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu subax kasta iyo fiid kasta waxay Rabbiga u gubaan qurbaan la gubo iyo foox udgoon, oo kibistii tusniintana waxay ku hagaajiyaan miiska daahirka ah korkiisa, oo laambadda dahabka ah iyo laambadaheedii waxay shidaan fiid kasta, waayo, annagu waan xajinnaa amarkii Rabbiga Ilaahaya ah, laakiinse idinku waad ka tagteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eega waxaa nala jira Ilaah isagoo madax noo ah, iyo wadaaddadiisii oo wata turumbooyinkii lagu dhawaajiya, oo waxay idinku afuufi doonaan dhawaaq, haddaba dadka Israa'iilow, ha la diririna Rabbiga ah Ilaaha awowayaashiin, waayo, liibaani maysaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yaaraabcaam wuxuu iyaga gadaal ka dhigay ciidan gaadmo ah, haddaba iyagu waxay hor joogeen dadkii Yahuudah oo ciidankii gaadmada ahaana wuxuu joogay gadaashooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Yahuudah markay gadaashooda eegeen waxay arkeen in hore iyo gadaalba laga soo weeraray, markaasay Rabbiga u qayshadeen, oo wadaaddadiina waxay ka dhawaajiyeen turumbooyinkii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay dadkii Yahuudah qayliyeen oo markay dadkii Yahuudah qayliyeen ayaa Rabbigu wax ku dhuftay Yaaraabcaam iyo dadkii Israa'iil oo dhan Abiiyaah iyo dadkii Yahuudah hortooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii Israa'iil ka carareen dadkii Yahuudah hortooda, oo Rabbiguna wuxuu ku riday gacantoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Abiiyaah iyo dadkiisiina aad bay u laayeen, oo waxaa dadkii Israa'iil ka le'day shan boqol oo kun oo ah rag la xushay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba dadkii Israa'iil sidaasaa wakhtigaas loo jebiyey oo waxaa ka adkaaday dadkii Yahuudah, maxaa yeelay, iyagu waxay isku halleeyeen Rabbiga ah Ilaaha awowayaashood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Abiiyaah baa eryaday Yaaraabcaam oo wuxuu ka qabsaday magaalooyin badan kuwaasoo ahaa Beytel iyo tuulooyinkeedii, iyo Yeshaanaah iyo tuulooyinkeedii, iyo Cefroon iyo tuulooyinkeedii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yaaraabcaamna xoog dambe ma uu helin wakhtigii Abiiyaah noolaa, oo Rabbiga ayaa wax ku riday, wuuna dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Abiiyaah wuu sii xoogaystay, oo wuxuu guursaday afar iyo toban naagood, oo wuxuuna dhalay laba iyo labaatan wiil iyo lix iyo toban gabdhood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Abiiyaah falimihiisii kale, iyo socodkiisii, iyo hadalladiisiiba waxay ku qoran yihiin kitaabkii Nebi Iddo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
